WEBVTT

00:11:59.424 --> 00:12:01.699
for the last 15 years.

00:12:01.699 --> 00:12:03.627
These are the kind of things that go on.

00:12:03.627 --> 00:12:06.710
If you take the Fortune 500 companies,

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:09.849
23 of them have women CEOs,

00:12:09.849 --> 00:12:11.660
out of 500,

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:14.795
and those CEOs, I need not tell you,

00:12:14.795 --> 00:12:16.792
make less on an average

00:12:16.792 --> 00:12:19.910
than the other CEOs.

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:22.388
Well, that's what goes on in our country.

00:12:22.388 --> 00:12:24.872
Another problem with the United States

00:12:24.872 --> 00:12:28.564
is we are the most warlike
nation on Earth.

00:12:28.564 --> 00:12:32.790
We have been to war
with about 25 different countries